WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:11.110
Ntụpọ atọ. Tupu ụtụtụ, eziokwu ga-apụta.

2
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.930
Mama n'onwe ya siri ya maka gị! Ofe ose
pụrụ iche!

3
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.250
Kemgbe olee mgbe Mama na-esiri m nri?

4
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.130
Ṅụọ ya, nwa m nwanyị. Ọ dị mma maka afọ
ime.

5
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.450
Ngwa ugbu a.

6
00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.500
Chere… gịnị bụ nke a?

7
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.510
Jizọs!

8
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.450
Mama, gịnị ka i tinyere n'ofe a?!

9
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.510
Ọ bụ mmanụ nsọ! Mmanụ nsọ! Mmanụ nsọ na-
elu ilu ntakịrị!

10
00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.300
Ehn ehn! Nsogbu abịala!

11
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.240
Chineke m!

12
00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.820
Ada… nke a adịghị m mma ma ọlị.

13
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:11.700
Gosi m.

14
00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.550
Mama, bido gị. Ọ bụ gị siri ya.

15
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.700
Ọ bụ ụbọchị ahụ ka m matara na… ofe ahụ
abụghị naanị maka m.
